Title:  Table of Artists and Tracks

Seq:    4.1

Level:  3 - Topic

Class:  text

Body:

Following is a table of [[Artists]] and[[Tracks]] that I discuss in *Reason to Rock*. The year listed reflects the original release of the featured track. The entries are initially sorted by year, but you may click on any of the headings to sort on that column. 

{:sort-table: tracks-table}
| Year | Artist | Title |
| ---- | ---- | ---- |
| 1936 | [[Robert Johnson]] | [[Come On In My Kitchen]] |
| 1957 | [[Chuck Berry]] | [[School Day]] |
| 1963 | [[Phil Spector]] | [[Christmas (Baby Please Come Home)]] |
| 1965 | [[Bob Dylan]] | [[Like A Rolling Stone]] |
| 1966 | [[The Beatles]] | [[Rain]] |
| 1967 | [[Buffalo Springfield]] | [[For What It's Worth]] |
| 1968 | [[Jimi Hendrix]] | [[All Along The Watchtower]] |
| 1968 | [[Cream]] | [[White Room]] |
| 1968 | [[Traffic]] | [[You Can All Join In]] |
| 1969 | [[Jefferson Airplane]] | [[We Can Be Together]] |
| 1969 | [[The Band]] | [[King Harvest (Has Surely Come)]] |
| 1970 | [[The Beach Boys]] | [[It's About Time]] |

